    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im on warfarin for my heart and my dr said my inr is a bit too high lately... like 4.2. i dont really wanna go back in for more blood tests yet if i can help it. is there like a specific vitamin or something i can take to bring it down quickly so i stay in the safe zone? i saw some stuff online about vitamin k supplements helping",
